     1960       ,input  trn-doc.obj-type
     1961       ,input  trn-doc.obj-code
     1962       ,input  0
     1963       ,input  0
     1964       ,input  0
     1965       ,input  true
     1966       ,output varlog
     1967       )  .
     1968   end.
     1969     if not varlog then return error.
     1970     if trn-doc.doc-type = 'инв':U then do:
     1971         assign inv-type:sensitive = yes
     1972                   inv-type:visible = yes.
     1973       end.
     1974     WAIT-FOR GO OF FRAME Dialog-Frame.
